      }
    },
    {
      "category": "other",
      "field": "alternative_interpretation",
      "value": "Some modern scholars such as Tom Harpur and Joseph Campbell have argued that religiō is derived from religare: re (meaning 'again') + ligare ('bind' or 'connect').",
